    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'concept', 'bank', 3, 'Why are diamond and graphite considered allotropes of carbon?', '["They contain different elements.","They have different atomic numbers.","They are different structural forms of the same element.","They have different chemical compositions."]'::jsonb, 'C', 1, '8e6d50ac47e7', null),
