    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'concept', 'bank', 3, 'The density of a gas is inversely proportional to its volume at constant pressure. This physical behavior is rooted in:', '["The compressibility of the gas due to vast intermolecular spaces","The chemical bonding between atoms","The high fluidity of the gas","The plasma state"]'::jsonb, 'A', 1, '8b7727b82389', null);
